        <div class="prose" style="max-width:720px">
          <p><em>Last reviewed: June 2026</em></p>

          <h2>Summary</h2>
          <p>This website only uses cookies and similar technologies to provide essential functionality. No tracking or analytics cookies are used.</p>

          <h2>What are cookies?</h2>
          <p>Cookies are small files saved on your device when you visit a website. We use them to make CodesThings.com work correctly.</p>

          <h2>Essential storage</h2>
          <p>The following items are stored locally on your device. They are never sent to any server operated by this site.</p>
          <table style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin-bottom:var(--space-md)">
            <thead>
              <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-border)">
                <th style="text-align:left;padding:var(--space-xs) var(--space-sm);font-size:var(--text-small)">Name</th>
                <th style="text-align:left;padding:var(--space-xs) var(--space-sm);font-size:var(--text-small)">Mechanism</th>
                <th style="text-align:left;padding:var(--space-xs) var(--space-sm);font-size:var(--text-small)">Purpose</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-border)">
                <td style="padding:var(--space-xs) var(--space-sm);font-size:var(--text-small)"><code>theme</code></td>
                <td style="padding:var(--space-xs) var(--space-sm);font-size:var(--text-small)">LocalStorage</td>
                <td style="padding:var(--space-xs) var(--space-sm);font-size:var(--text-small)">Stores your light/dark theme preference.</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td style="padding:var(--space-xs) var(--space-sm);font-size:var(--text-small)"><code>campsnapFabDismissed</code></td>
                <td style="padding:var(--space-xs) var(--space-sm);font-size:var(--text-small)">LocalStorage</td>
                <td style="padding:var(--space-xs) var(--space-sm);font-size:var(--text-small)">Remembers that you dismissed the Campsnap prompt so it doesn't reappear.</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>

          <h2>Third-party services</h2>
          <p>This site loads resources from the following third parties, which may set their own cookies or log requests:</p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Google Fonts</strong> — loaded from <code>fonts.googleapis.com</code>. Subject to <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Google's Privacy Policy</a>.</li>
            <li><strong>jsDelivr CDN</strong> — icons loaded from <code>cdn.jsdelivr.net</code>. Subject to <a href="https://www.jsdelivr.com/privacy-policy-jsdelivr-net" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">jsDelivr's Privacy Policy</a>.</li>
            <li><strong>GitHub Pages</strong> — this site is hosted on GitHub Pages. Subject to <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">GitHub's Privacy Statement</a>.</li>
          </ul>

          <h2>Managing cookies</h2>
          <p>You can manage or delete cookies and local storage through your browser settings. Clearing local storage will reset your theme preference and Campsnap dismissal.</p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Chrome:</strong> Settings → Privacy and Security → Cookies and other site data</li>
            <li><strong>Firefox:</strong> Settings → Privacy & Security → Cookies and Site Data</li>
            <li><strong>Safari:</strong> Preferences → Privacy → Manage Website Data</li>
            <li><strong>Edge:</strong> Settings → Cookies and site permissions</li>
          </ul>

          <h2>More information</h2>
          <p>The <a href="https://ico.org.uk/for-organisations/guide-to-pecr/guidance-on-the-use-of-cookies-and-similar-technologies/what-are-cookies-and-similar-technologies/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Information Commissioner's Office</a> provides up-to-date guidance on the use of cookies and similar technologies.</p>
